@startuml
title SkillBridge - Global Architecture
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6F8
  BorderColor #1F3A5F
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FFF4E8
  BorderColor #E67E22
}
skinparam ArrowColor #20242A

actor "Learner / Admin" as User

rectangle "apps/frontend\nReact + TypeScript + Vite" as Frontend #EAF7F5
rectangle "apps/backend\nSpring Boot REST API" as Backend #EAF7F5
database "Supabase PostgreSQL\nApplication database" as Supabase
file "events.log\nJSON Lines web events" as Events #F4F6F8
rectangle "apps/bigdata\nTerminal-first Hadoop lab" as BigData #EEF3FA
database "HDFS raw / processed zones" as HDFS
rectangle "Hive SQL\nMapReduce\nHBase course_stats" as Analytics #EEF3FA
file "output/*.json\nAdmin summaries" as Summaries #F4F6F8

User --> Frontend : browser
Frontend --> Backend : HTTPS / JSON API
Backend --> Supabase : Spring Data JPA
Backend --> Events : append usage events
Events --> BigData : Flume streaming ingestion
Supabase ..> BigData : curated catalog copied\nto local mirror
BigData --> HDFS : Sqoop + Flume
HDFS --> Analytics : query and process
Analytics --> Summaries : generated reports
Summaries ..> Backend : file-based status API
Backend --> Frontend : dashboards and responses
@enduml

